  "body": "## What\n\n- `FALLBACK_BENCH_ENABLED` (default `false`) — the toggle the user asked for. OFF = old direct-retry/direct-fallback, no throttling. ON = rate-based eject + kind-aware bench durations.\n- Rate-based eject: trip when 50%+ of the last 10 requests failed (8-sample floor).\n- Kind-aware bench durations: 5xx/transient → 1s, rate_limit → provider Retry-After, auth/quota → eject_seconds, sustained rate-based → eject_seconds.\n- Retry-once for the primary on transient errors (`FALLBACK_RETRY_FIRST=retry_once`).\n- Admin UI toggle registered in the limits section.\n\n## Verification\n\nCI 5/5 green. 153+ tests pass. ruff/ty clean.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
